  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity UK contribution to the malaria match fund 2020-2022 is a component of UK investment in the Global Fund 2020-2022 to reduce transmission and mortality for HIV AIDS, tuberculosis and malaria through treatments, diagnostics and preventive technologies and related services reported by FCDO with a funding type of 109 - Multilateral organisation and a budget of &#xa3;200,000,000. This project benefits Developing countries, unspecified. It works in the following sector(s): Sectors not specified.</narrative>
